  Slug: primal-hierophant
  DisplayName: Primal Hierophant
  IconPath: icons/weapons/wands/wand-crook-yellow.webp
  Description: You command the most potent forces of primal magic and can cast a
    spell of truly incredible power. You gain a single 10th-rank spell slot and can
    prepare a spell in that slot using druid spellcasting. Unlike with other spell
    slots, you can't use 10-rank slots with abilities that give you more spell slots
    or that let you cast spells without expending spell slots. You don't gain more
    10th-rank spells as you level up, but you can take the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hierophant's
    Power] feat to gain a second slot.
